Error [E0955]: `embed_file` can't read `embed_binary.dat` as text
  --> tests/ui/comptime_embed_not_utf8.jet:1:20
    |
  1 | TEXT :: comptime { embed_file("embed_binary.dat") }
    |                    ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The file isn't valid UTF-8; `embed_file` returns a String
 Fix: Embed it with `embed_bytes("path")` instead — it returns raw `[U8]`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0955
